# svc-pc-compare: a Pokémon Center PC (Jubilife) with the Contest Hall
# visited (the Storage System lists COMPARE POKéMON). MOVE POKéMON: mark Bidoof (circle, heart, diamond),
# release Starly; COMPARE POKéMON: Turtwig set on the left, Bidoof live on the right, the three pages.
# The marks survive a save round trip.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_TURTWIG 9
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_STARLY 6
party 2 platinum:SPECIES_BIDOOF 4
set flag platinum:FLAG_CONTEST_HALL_VISITED true
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_JUBILIFE_CITY_POKECENTER_1F 12 4 up
until idle
+1 press a
+1 release a
advance text
+0 assert message open
# SOMEONE'S PC
+5 press a
+1 release a
advance text
# MOVE POKéMON (DEPOSIT, WITHDRAW, MOVE, MOVE ITEMS, COMPARE, SEE YA!)
+5 press down
+1 release down
+1 press down
+1 release down
+1 press a
+1 release a
until app storage
# MARK on Bidoof: the markings window, circle, heart and diamond, CONFIRM
+1 tap party:2
+1 tap menu:2
+1 tap mark:0
+1 tap mark:3
+1 tap mark:5
+1 screenshot mark
+1 tap mark:6
+1 assert state party[2].markings 41
# RELEASE Starly: "Release this Pokémon?" (NO first), YES, "was released", "Bye-bye"
+1 tap party:1
+1 tap menu:3
+1 tap yes
+1 press a
+1 release a
+1 press a
+1 release a
+1 assert state party.length 2
+0 assert state party[1].species "platinum:SPECIES_BIDOOF"
+1 tap close
+1 tap yes
until app none
advance text
# COMPARE POKéMON: the cursor starts on the box header
+5 press down
+1 release down
+1 press down
+1 release down
+1 press down
+1 release down
+1 press down
+1 release down
+1 press a
+1 release a
until app storage
+1 tap party:0
+1 tap menu:0
+1 press down
+1 release down
+0 screenshot compare
+1 tap compare:page
+1 screenshot compare-contest
+1 tap compare:page
+1 screenshot compare-moves
+1 tap close
+1 tap yes
until app none
advance text
# B leaves the Storage System, B again switches the PC off
+5 press b
+1 release b
advance text
+5 press b
+1 release b
until idle
+1 reload
+0 assert state party[1].markings 41
+0 assert state party.length 2
until idle
